From 6070b98a1187dde23ad0cc40efbff099470cc6b3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ajensenwaud <ajensenwaud@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 04:39:30 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 23/24] inkling2: the batched draft pass under the kernel
 contract

Each of the six new launches runs the reference and the planted control of
the kernel it copies, from a one-stream table. Compile records from nvcc
13.0 on sm_80/86/89/120/121 (later_pending), 13.3 in pending_133.zig; the
dspark image's twelve older kernels keep their SASS on every SM and both
compilers.
---
